      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">نَاقَةٌ زَلُوقٌ</span></b>  <i>A quick,</i> or <i>swift, she-camel;</i> (AZ,
K;) as also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">زَلُوجٌ</span>. (AZ, TA.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  And <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عُقْبَةٌ زَلُوقٌ</span>
